  only Alliance
  zone Loch Modan
  tip Mageroyal (skill 50) and Earthroot (skill 15) are the herbs this brew band eats, and Briarthorn from 70 is the next band's. Pick all three and keep Briarthorn aside. Darkshore is the alternative if the loch is picked clean.
