  only Horde
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip Mageroyal (skill 50) and Earthroot (skill 15) are the herbs this brew band eats, and Briarthorn from 70 is the next band's. Pick all three and keep Briarthorn aside. Stranglekelp grows underwater along the shore from 85, so watch your breath.
