step Minor Mana Potion, Elixir of Minor Fortitude (55-90)
  tip Minor Mana Potion, 10 brews to 65, then Elixir of Minor Fortitude, 28 brews to 90: two Earthroot in each of the second. In Forever the trainer teaches Minor Mana Potion from skill 25, well before this band. Keep any Frilled Lichen you picked on the way: Cerulean Dye is the first Scarce dye you can brew.
  learn 2331 "Minor Mana Potion"
  craft 2331 "Minor Mana Potion" until 65
  learn 2334 "Elixir of Minor Fortitude"
  craft 2334 "Elixir of Minor Fortitude" until 90

section Alchemy 90-130

step Briarthorn and Kingsblood to 150 (Hillsbrad Foothills)
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Take Herbalism from 100 to 150 here (the Journeyman cap). Briarthorn needs 70 and Stranglekelp 85 for this brew band; Bruiseweed, Wild Steelbloom and Kingsblood (from 125) feed the next two. Stonetalon Mountains is the alternative. Look for Rosecap bonus drops on every node and keep all of them: it becomes Magenta Dye at Alchemy 130.
  goto 67.5,37.6 "Liferoot, Wild Steelbloom" r 30
  goto 63.6,37.6 "Liferoot, Kingsblood" r 30
  goto 67.3,32.2 "Liferoot, Wild Steelbloom" r 30
  goto 72.4,28.0 "Bruiseweed, Kingsblood" r 30
  goto 81.4,32.3 "Bruiseweed, Kingsblood" r 30
  goto 64.1,53.6 "Bruiseweed, Wild Steelbloom" r 30
  goto 38.3,51.9 "Kingsblood, Bruiseweed" r 30
  goto 71.6,62.6 "Bruiseweed, Kingsblood" r 30
  skill Herbalism 150

step Alchemy 90-130: Auction House
  tip What the next elixirs take that the Auction House sells: 40 Mageroyal, 60 Briarthorn, 10 Stranglekelp. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold.
  auction 785 x40
  auction 2450 x60
  auction 3820 x10

step Alchemy 90-130: herbs
  tip Briarthorn grows in the 10-25 zones; Stranglekelp grows along coasts and riverbanks in the 10-30 zones. Use what you picked while leveling Herbalism, or take them from your bank.
  collect 785 x40 anywhere gather Herbalism 50
  collect 2450 x60 anywhere gather Herbalism 70
  collect 3820 x10 anywhere gather Herbalism 85

step Alchemy 90-130: vendor goods
  tip Empty Vials come from Alchemy supply vendors; most trainers have one nearby.
  buy 3371 x40 nearest

step Elixir of Wisdom, Lesser Mana Potion (90-130)
  tip Elixir of Wisdom, 30 brews to 120: two Briarthorn in each. Then Lesser Mana Potion, 10 brews to 130. Keep the Elixirs of Wisdom if you also level Tailoring: the Gloves of Meditation need them. At Alchemy 130 Magenta Dye opens: hoard your Rosecap for it.
  learn 3171 "Elixir of Wisdom"
  craft 3171 "Elixir of Wisdom" until 120
  learn 3173 "Lesser Mana Potion"
  craft 3173 "Lesser Mana Potion" until 130

section Alchemy 130-150

step Alchemy 130-150: Auction House
  tip What Fire Oil takes that the Auction House sells: 40 Firefin Snapper. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold. This band needs no herbs, so use the time to pick Kingsblood and Stranglekelp ahead of the next one.
  auction 6359 x40

step Alchemy 130-150: fish
  tip Firefin Snapper is fished in mid-level waters: catch them yourself, or take them from your bank.
  collect 6359 x40 anywhere gather Fishing 75

step Alchemy 130-150: vendor goods
  tip Empty Vials come from Alchemy supply vendors; most trainers have one nearby.
  buy 3371 x20 nearest

step Fire Oil (130-150)
  tip Fire Oil, 20 brews to 150. Each brew makes two oils, so you end with 40: keep 30 of them for the Elixir of Fire Power next. Fire Oil is cheaper here than more Lesser Mana Potions, and the next step needs it anyway.
  learn 7837 "Fire Oil"
  craft 7837 "Fire Oil" until 150

