step Purple Lotus and Firebloom to 230 (Tanaris)
  zone Tanaris
  tip Take Herbalism from 200 to 230 here: Purple Lotus and Firebloom give the points, and Sungrass unlocks at 230 for the last Alchemy bands. Liferoot and Stranglekelp for this brew band should already be in your bags from the earlier loops; pick extra Liferoot whenever you pass it. Searing Gorge is the alternative zone.
