step Hinterlands Herbs to 250
  zone The Hinterlands
  tip Take Herbalism from 230 to 250 here. Sungrass and Purple Lotus give points, and Ghost Mushroom (skill 245) grows in caves and dark hollows. Blindweed needs skill 235 and grows in the Swamp of Sorrows: if you are passing through for Artisan Alchemy as Horde, pick it on the way. Keep any Stranglevine you meet, and brew Viridian Dye once Alchemy reaches 230.
  goto 57.5,42.5 "Ghost Mushroom, Purple Lotus" r 30
  goto 51.7,41.0 "Golden Sansam, Sungrass" r 30
  goto 47.0,53.4 "Sungrass, Purple Lotus" r 30
