step Stonescale Oil, Elixir of Greater Intellect (250-265)
  tip Stonescale Oil, 47 brews to 260. Each brew makes two oils, so you end with 94: keep all of them for the Elixir of Greater Defense next. Then Elixir of Greater Intellect, 10 more brews to 265. If Stonescale Eel is expensive, skip the oil, keep making Elixir of Greater Intellect to 265 (about 21 more), and finish on Superior Mana Potions instead: 55 brews to 300 (110 Sungrass, 110 Blindweed, 55 Crystal Vial), recipe from Algernon in the Undercity or Ulthir in Darnassus.
  learn 17551 "Stonescale Oil"
  craft 17551 "Stonescale Oil" until 260
  craft 11465 "Elixir of Greater Intellect" until 265

section Alchemy 265-300

step Sungrass to Plaguebloom to 300 (Felwood)
  zone Felwood
  tip Take Herbalism from 250 to 300 here. Sungrass, Gromsblood, Golden Sansam, Dreamfoil, Mountain Silversage and Plaguebloom all give points at this level, so pick everything you pass. Your last brew band eats 44 Sungrass: stock them now. Keep every Rosecap, Stranglevine and Frilled Lichen you collected for the dye recipes and for any crafting partner; they are what makes this pair worth running.
  goto 52.9,27.4 "Gromsblood, Sungrass" r 30
  goto 48.0,23.8 "Plaguebloom, Dreamfoil" r 30
  goto 42.7,17.2 "Dreamfoil, Gromsblood" r 30
  goto 53.3,17.2 "Sungrass, Dreamfoil" r 30
  goto 56.5,21.8 "Golden Sansam, Plaguebloom" r 30
  goto 56.0,8.5 "Sungrass, Gromsblood" r 30
  goto 38.3,52.8 "Sungrass, Gromsblood" r 30
  goto 41.0,58.1 "Dreamfoil, Sungrass" r 30
  skill Herbalism 300

step Alchemy 265-300: Auction House
  tip What the last elixirs take that the Auction House sells: 44 Sungrass. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold.
  auction 8838 x44

step Alchemy 265-300: herbs
  tip Sungrass grows in the 40-55 zones: use what you picked in Felwood, or take it from your bank.
