step Recipe: Elixir of Superior Defense
  tip The recipe item is still called Recipe: Elixir of Superior Defense, and it teaches Elixir of Greater Defense: the elixir was renamed in Forever, the recipe item was not. Sold by Kor'geld in Orgrimmar and Soolie Berryfizz in Ironforge, limited stock.
  buy 13478 x1 nearest

step Elixir of Greater Defense (265-300)
  tip Elixir of Greater Defense, 44 brews to 300: two of the kept Stonescale Oils in each. It turns yellow at 280, so make a few more if you come up short of 300. Use the recipe first to learn it. At 300 both professions are maxed: spend your Alchemy Legacy Points, and craft dyes from your stored Lichen, Rosecap and Stranglevine.
  learn 17554 "Elixir of Greater Defense"
  craft 17554 "Elixir of Greater Defense" until 300
